Package: twingate-tray
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: twingate, policykit-1
Maintainer: Sphexi <admin@sphexi.com>
Description: System tray application for the Twingate Linux CLI
 Provides a graphical system tray interface for managing Twingate
 VPN connections on Linux. Features include connect/disconnect,
 resource browsing, account management, exit node routing, and
 desktop notifications.
Homepage: https://github.com/benyanke/twingate-linux-gui
